title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (cardinal candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,j\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(M,j\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is a class target and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:V\\to M\">\\(j:V\\to M\\)</span> is a class function in the ambient class metatheory</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S\\)</span> (transitive-class predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"362d2f33099adc89\" href=\"?note=362d2f33099adc89\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4SuperhugeCardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4SuperhugeCardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}superhuge\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4SuperhugeCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\to\n\\exists M,j\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S(M)\n\\land j:V\\to M\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}{}\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\n\\forall\\vec a\\in V^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n\\bigl((V,\\in)\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\n\\leftrightarrow(M,\\in)\\models\\varphi[j\\circ\\vec a]\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}{}\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\n\\land\\lambda&lt;j(\\kappa)\n\\land\\bigl({}^{j(\\kappa)}M\\cap V\\bigr)\\subseteq M\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}superhuge\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4SuperhugeCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\to\n\\exists M,j\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S(M)\n\\land j:V\\to M\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}{}\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\n\\forall\\vec a\\in V^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n\\bigl((V,\\in)\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\n\\leftrightarrow(M,\\in)\\models\\varphi[j\\circ\\vec a]\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}{}\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\n\\land\\lambda&lt;j(\\kappa)\n\\land\\bigl({}^{j(\\kappa)}M\\cap V\\bigr)\\subseteq M\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The embedding and its target are proper-class objects interpreted schematically in the ambient class metatheory; the ordinary set-function predicate is not applied to the domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The final clause says that every set-coded sequence of members of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> of length <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j(\\kappa)\">\\(j(\\kappa)\\)</span> belongs to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>. Replacing this by closure only under <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>-sequences would define a weaker large-cardinal property.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"362d2f33099adc89","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"362d2f33099adc89","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S$ (transitive-class predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"M,j\\in\\mathsf{Cls}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"j:V\\to M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4SuperhugeCardinal}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}superhuge\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4SuperhugeCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\\kappa<\\lambda\\to\n\\exists M,j\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S(M)\n\\land j:V\\to M\\\\\n&\\hspace{16mm}{}\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\n\\forall\\vec a\\in V^{<\\omega}\\;\n\\bigl((V,\\in)\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\n\\leftrightarrow(M,\\in)\\models\\varphi[j\\circ\\vec a]\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{16mm}{}\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\n\\land\\lambda<j(\\kappa)\n\\land\\bigl({}^{j(\\kappa)}M\\cap V\\bigr)\\subseteq M\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"j(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false}],"bytes":2107,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2437","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-largecard4-superhuge-cardinal.md|58-df-zfc-largecard4-superhuge-cardinal]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5fb1c2241d1943d1","65418b505fc53093","8b6a90316aad78a4","362d2f33099adc89"]}